# Local dev config for the web app. Vite auto-loads this file; copy it to
# .env and fill in real values: `cp .env.example .env`.

# Optional: enables the address field's Google autocomplete (and triggers
# the drive-time calculation the moment an address is selected). Without it,
# the address field is a plain input and drive time stays manual-entry only.
#
# This must be a BROWSER-restricted key (HTTP referrers) with the Maps
# JavaScript API + Places API enabled — a different key than the API's
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY, which is IP-restricted and used server-side for the
# Distance Matrix API. Create one at
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY='your_browser_key_here'
